  "text": "### 5. Unauthorized Account Access (Account Takeover)  \n**Example:** Customer discovers account used without permission  \n**Investigation:**\n- Immediate account freeze\n- Transaction review\n- Authentication review (password change?)\n- Fraud team escalation\n- Law enforcement notification (if warranted)  \n**Resolution:**\n- Full reimbursement of fraudulent transactions\n- Account security reset\n- Replacement card/online access reset\n- Credit monitoring (if identity theft)\n- Regular follow-up  \n---",
